  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Addition of Roof Terrace with 60cm parapet wall with 40cm metal railing.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed roof terrace, by reason of inappropriate scale, detailed design and location, would result in an unsympathetic, obtrusive and incongruous form of development, which would detrimentally impact the character and appearance of the application site and wider terrace.&amp;nbsp; As such the proposed development is contrary to policy D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Local Plan 2033 and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2009.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed roof terrace, by virtue of its design, siting and scale is considered to lead to a detrimental impact on the amenity of the neighbours in terms of perceived overlooking, noise and disturbance, contrary to policies LP2 (Development and Amenity), LP58 (Improving the Environment) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, policy D14 (Noise) of the London Plan (2021) and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2009.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
